    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Abstract base class for registry listeners, which are informed when new entries are added to the registry. Simply subclass and instantiate:</para><para><programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal">class<sp/>CollectorPrinter<sp/>:<sp/>public<sp/>Registry&lt;Collector&gt;::listener<sp/>{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">protected:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>void<sp/>registered(const<sp/>Registry&lt;Collector&gt;::entry<sp/>&amp;e)<sp/>{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>cerr<sp/>&lt;&lt;<sp/>&quot;collector<sp/>now<sp/>available:<sp/>&quot;<sp/>&lt;&lt;<sp/>e-&gt;getName()<sp/>&lt;&lt;<sp/>&quot;\n&quot;;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>}</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">public:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>CollectorPrinter()<sp/>{<sp/>init();<sp/>}<sp/><sp/>//<sp/>Print<sp/>those<sp/>already<sp/>registered.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">};</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">CollectorPrinter<sp/>Printer;</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting> </para>    </detaileddescription>
